    {
      "text": "Optimistic calculations about the Witten-Reshetikhin-Turaev invariants of closed three-manifolds obtained from the figure-eight knot by integral Dehn surgeries — I calculate optimistically asymptotic\n\n**Optimistic calculations about the Witten-Reshetikhin-Turaev invariants of closed three-manifolds obtained from the figure-eight knot by integral Dehn surgeries**\n\n10 pp, 5 sections.\n\n**Abstract.** I calculate optimistically asymptotic behaviors of the WRT $SU(2)$ invariants for the three-manifolds obtained from the ﬁgure-eight knot by p- surgeries with $p=0,1,2,$ $\\ldots,$ $10$ , from which one can extract volumes and the Chern-Simons invariants of these closed manifolds. I conjecture that this also holds for general closed three-manifolds.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 2 THE; 3 AN OPTIMISTIC LIMIT; 4 DEHN SURGERY ALONG THE FIGURE-EIGHT KNOT; 5 VOLUME CONJECTURE FOR CLOSED THREE-MANIFOLDS",
      "lang": "en",
